<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican forces killed a commander of the Cártel de Guasave in Sinaloa, a leader wanted by the United States. In the United States, federal and local authorities charged dozens of suspects linked to the Sinaloa cartel in Middle Tennessee and arrested nine individuals in San Bernardino County for a train cargo theft tied to the cartel. A murder suspect was extradited from Mexico to Santa Monica and is being held on a $3 million bail. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNanRjVXlzQ1hDajRLOXgwcnF4allHbmlnbjUzVENncGJnb0ZqaFF0bzdFcTh4VER4d1c2ZzdDeFV5T05RU0ZXN3NFZVQzOFpMc1hITzJBTDRvYXN0LUMzcGU0VkJmN1RzdFJnQVdFS3h3VWphT1pJMy1IMmJZbk9lVF9yQVdXZjN6X2FrUy1VaTNmUG9VTjZmWENMc1Y?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNTHZodTJlTTlaTU5odjBQVWpFa1FVRlZYQkh3dnBHQkN5T08yQlVnb3FmMldBUzB1alp2M2NLS2hnWDNSZndQUF9IdDRuMDRqU2lwNDRhbFpzdVZMeDRYT1RPbVJsSTVUOGxGTEFCdWIyamFXb3REdnNQTkhJTWhFZ3lrY09HYkZ2RkZUQnhPUnd0N1JldlpxQTZnV2l2UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WORLD News Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;News-Herald.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFBiWjJoYTZQaVpxOW1oX2I3Tmh4US1QQzdBd0xBVHpFdEwtQTJ2ZUIxOTNIbDVHbHhNTWRXNmpMckhrVUhtN21teG92VWZST3d3V2pvUjVQR21nZkdLU1JMQmNsMkstY2RGd0Z6OXZHMmpld1lq?oc=5&quot;&gt;Decider&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lebanon Democrat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQc29XU0xUY3ZQeHc3SzBJQ1JXVHNBTkpkdFB1SXlfYTVpQklwSEpyeGhaR3pXbTd0VjZxMzFaOVdseGV5SXFPTklETVY0RmxuZll4SHlmV29veXVET3JWZG5QQVhZSUZLazVOQjZyckIwa0RCLUZva1EwMGdSQkdhSk5kZW1fajA?oc=5&quot;&gt;CW39 Houston&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/